1,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Soft / Compliant Grippers</b>: Constructed from flexible materials that passively deform around delicate or irregularly shaped items</span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,1,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,1,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-242\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,2,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Magnetic Grippers</b>: Ideal for lifting ferrous materials and steel sheets</span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,2,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2,1,2,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-243\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><i data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Selection Factors</i>: Object shape, mass, surface texture, fragility, and available actuator power</span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span></p></li></ul>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:5001/uploads/c89224a4-2ec0-42cd-92ab-cde6ca6042d1.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\">\r\n\n<!-- lesson15-16-content-expansion-v1 -->\n<p><strong>Contact Geometry:</strong> Finger pads should contact surfaces with enough area and alignment to distribute pressure. Rounded or compliant pads can tolerate small pose errors, while rigid pads provide repeatable contact when the part geometry is tightly controlled.</p>\n<p><strong>Actuator Sizing:</strong> A gripper actuator must provide enough force and stroke for the object while still operating within its duty cycle. Transmission losses, acceleration loads, and the worst-case object orientation should be included when selecting the actuator.</p>\n<p><strong>Feedback and Verification:</strong> Position sensing can confirm that the jaws closed, but it does not always prove that an object is present. Combining jaw position with motor current, force sensing, or a payload check gives the sequence stronger evidence of a successful grasp.</p>',24,16,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJDfeI_h9Go',NULL,'top','2026-10-21 12:28:21'),(6,1,1,'L15.5 — Grasping and Contact Forces','L15.5 — Grasping and Contact Forces','\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-244\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">A stable grasp must successfully resist gravitational forces and external disturbances to ensure secure transportation</span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"19,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"20\" style=\"padding-inline-start: 32px;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-245\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Forces to Consider</b>: The primary downward force is the object\'s gravitational weight (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"W = mg\" data-index-in-node=\"85\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">W = mg</span>)</span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Gripper fingers apply normal contact forces inward, while frictional forces counteract sliding tendencies</span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. The specific location of each contact point directly influences overall grasp stability</span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0,5\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0,6\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Stable vs. Unstable Grasps</b><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">:</span></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1\" style=\"padding-inline-start: 32px;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-246\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,0,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Stable</b>: Contact forces and friction completely prevent unwanted translation, slip, rotation, or dropping</span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,0,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,0,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-247\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,1,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Unstable</b>: Inadequate friction or poor contact distribution causes the object to slip, tilt, or fall</span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,1,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,1,1,1,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-248\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Force Optimization</b>: More grip force is not always better</span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Fragile objects require strict force limits to avoid crushing or structural damage</span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. The design goal is to apply just enough grip force to securely hold the object without damaging it</span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0,5\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0,6\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:5001/uploads/b92da691-d328-488a-9fe4-03379e6518b4.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\">\r\n<div>\r\n<span data-path-to-node=\"18,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">A stable grasp requires balancing the downward gravitational force (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"W = mg\" data-index-in-node=\"68\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">W = mg</span>) with finger contact forces and friction to prevent slipping without crushing delicate items</span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"18,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">  </sources-carousel-inline>\r\n<br></div>\n<!-- lesson15-16-content-expansion-v1 -->\n<p><strong>Friction Dependence:</strong> The available tangential friction is proportional to normal force, but the coefficient changes with material, dust, moisture, and pad wear. A robust grasp therefore uses measured or conservatively estimated friction rather than relying on an ideal laboratory value.</p>\n<p><strong>Contact Placement:</strong> Contacts placed near the object center of mass reduce the tendency to rotate, while widely separated contacts increase the resisting moment. The grasp should also account for acceleration and deceleration forces during transfer, not only gravity.</p>\n<p><strong>Force Ramping:</strong> Closing the fingers gradually allows sensors to detect contact before the full command is applied. This prevents impacts and lets the controller stop increasing force when the object is secure, especially for fragile or deformable parts.</p>',24,16,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_7T1UWM69FA',NULL,'top','2026-10-21 12:31:47'),(7,1,1,'L15.6 — Static Equilibrium of the Arm','L15.6 — Static Equilibrium of the Arm','\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-249\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"23,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">When a robotic arm holds a stationary load, all forces and moments acting throughout the mechanical structure must achieve complete equilibrium</span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"23,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"24\" style=\"padding-inline-start: 32px;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-250\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Force Balance</b>: For static equilibrium, the net vector sum of all external forces must equal zero (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\sum F = 0\" data-index-in-node=\"98\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">∑ F = 0</span>)</span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. This requires analyzing gravitational forces and finger contact forces across the object and arm segments independently</span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,0,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-251\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Torque and Moments</b>: Torque is generated by force multiplied by the perpendicular lever arm distance (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\tau = r \\times F\" data-index-in-node=\"101\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">τ = r × F</span>)</span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Joint motors must supply sufficient torque to support both the weight of the arm segments and the external payload</span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Operating with a longer reach increases the effective moment arm, significantly increasing required joint torque</span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,5\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,1,0,6\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-252\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Center of Mass</b>: Mass distribution directly affects structural balance</span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Changes in load position alter joint effort requirements, necessitating continuous checks of arm stability</span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,2,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-253\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><i data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Simplified Condition</i>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\sum F = 0\" data-index-in-node=\"22\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">∑ F = 0</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\sum \\tau = 0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">∑ τ = 0</span> must hold true when the system is at rest</span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"24,3,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:5001/uploads/da721aec-0661-4eca-a840-fca9142e3a5f.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\"><div><span data-path-to-node=\"26,0\"></span>\r\n<span data-path-to-node=\"22,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">When an arm holds a stationary load, forces and moments must balance (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\sum F = 0\" data-index-in-node=\"70\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">∑ F = 0</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-math=\"\\sum \\tau = 0\" data-index-in-node=\"85\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">∑ τ = 0</span>)</span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,1\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Longer reach increases lever arms, increasing the required joint torque</span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,3\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"22,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"> </sources-carousel-inline><br></div>\n<!-- lesson15-16-content-expansion-v1 -->\n<p><strong>Moment Balance:</strong> A payload creates a moment that grows with its perpendicular distance from the joint axis. Moving the object farther from the base can therefore increase required actuator torque even when the object mass stays constant.</p>\n<p><strong>Static Versus Dynamic Loads:</strong> Static equilibrium describes a stopped arm, but acceleration adds inertial forces during motion. Motor and structural sizing should include a dynamic margin so that a system that is stable at rest does not overload when it starts or stops.</p>\n<p><strong>Support Reaction:</strong> The base and mounting structure must carry the combined reaction forces and moments from the links and payload. A stable floor attachment and correctly tightened fasteners are part of the equilibrium problem, not details outside the model.</p>',24,16,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TT0tllWGrMY',NULL,'top','2026-10-21 12:38:26'),(8,1,1,'L15.7 — Position Control and Force Control','L15.7 — Position Control and Force Control','\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-254\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"27,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Advanced robotic manipulation combines precise spatial movement with safe, compliant contact regulation</span><span data-path-to-node=\"27,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"27,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"28\" style=\"padding-inline-start: 32px;   margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-255\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Position Control</b>: Drives joints and the end-effector toward target coordinates</span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. Feedback loops measure actual position data to continuously reduce tracking error</span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. This is ideal for reaching, transferring, and placing tasks in open space</span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0,5\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0,6\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-256\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Force Control</b>: Regulates the magnitude of physical force exerted during contact</span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">. This is critical when grasping delicate items or pressing tools against workpieces to avoid excessive pushing force or breakage</span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0,3\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0,4\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-257\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0,0\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><i data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Practical Sequence</i>: A typical operational sequence utilizes position control to approach a workpiece, followed by force and contact feedback control to execute a secure, delicate grasp</span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0,2\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" _nghost-ng-c1750423854=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">   <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1750423854=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2931205832=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:5001/uploads/aa7bcc5d-bb8c-4258-b409-2f0d516dafef.png\" alt=\"Pasted image\">\r\n<div>\r\n<span data-path-to-node=\"26,0\">Advanced manipulation combines position control for reaching targets with force control to regulate physical contact pressure during delicate operations</span><span data-path-to-node=\"26,1\"><span><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"26,2\">.</span><br></div>\n<!-- lesson15-16-content-expansion-v1 -->\n<p><strong>Feedback Loop:</strong> Encoders report the measured joint position, and the controller compares it with the commanded trajectory to form an error signal. Gains must be tuned high enough for accurate tracking without causing oscillation, noise amplification, or excessive actuator effort.</p>\n<p><strong>Compliance:</strong> Hybrid or impedance control can make the arm stiff in free space while allowing controlled yielding during contact. This is useful for insertion, polishing, and surface following where a rigid position command could damage the part.</p>\n<p><strong>Transition Management:</strong> Switching from position control to force control should use a defined contact event and a bounded transition. Filtering sensor readings and limiting force changes prevents a noisy contact measurement from producing an abrupt command.</p>',24,16,'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1JdH_ytpzpk',NULL,'top','2026-10-21 12:44:45'),(9,1,1,'L15.8 — Pick-and-Place Sequence','L15.8 — Pick-and-Place Sequence','\r\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\" id=\"p-rc_8e7fb282b1ba2638-258\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"31,0\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">Complex manipulation workflows are best broken down into explicit, sequential execution states</span><span data-path-to-node=\"31,1\" class=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><span style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><response-element class=\"no-md\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c46153305=\"\" class=\"superscript\" style=\"margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;\"></sup></source-footnote></response-element></span></span><span data-path-to-node=\"31,2\" style=\"marg